Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.76,0:01:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After we climbed Infinity Mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.02,0:01:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we found ourselves right\Nbetween Leomon and Ogremon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.42,0:01:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were being controlled by\NDevimon, a most heinous character.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.36,0:01:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devimon thinks that we were brought\Nto the DigiWorld to defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.72,0:01:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he's slightly confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.24,0:01:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We escaped with the help of a well-timed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.72,0:01:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve and discovered\Na mansion where we ate,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.18,0:01:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cleaned up, and tried to get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:02:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, it was all an\Nillusion created by Devimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.04,0:02:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He destroyed the whole island\Nand split all us kids up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.78,0:02:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I think we're in trouble.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.48,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Clash! The Freezing Digimon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.22,0:02:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gekitotsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.13,0:02:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reitou Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.70,0:02:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to that creep,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.06,0:02:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devimon File Island broke up and all us\Nkids got separated Now he's up there in his
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.18,0:02:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,castle on Infinity Mountain and I hate to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.46,0:02:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think what horrible\Nthings he's planning next
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.08,0:02:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that they're on their own those\Nlittle intruders will meet their doom
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.98,0:02:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing can stand in my way the\NDigidestined don't have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.18,0:02:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now fly, my pet eagles. Fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.90,0:02:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, it's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.14,0:02:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry and I wish\Nwe were on solid ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.74,0:02:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like you're about to\Nget your wish but next time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.74,0:03:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be careful of what you wish for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.58,0:03:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just might get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.04,0:03:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,okay so mom was right i\Nshould have worn a sweater
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.42,0:03:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take it easy Agumon i'll pull you out
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.46,0:03:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey look i found my clothes\Nexcept they're even too cold
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.56,0:03:25.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for me now don't worry i can\Ngive you the latest hot look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.56,0:03:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Agumon, that's smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.38,0:03:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now can you hook up my pants?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.56,0:03:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oops, nuked him a little too long,\Nbut look on the bright side, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.50,0:03:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What bright side?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.00,0:03:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't be cold anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.18,0:03:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.09,0:03:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mailboxes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.01,0:03:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, maybe people really\Nlived here at one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.96,0:03:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish we could mail ourselves home,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.90,0:03:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it looks like the only way\Nwe'll ever leave Breezeland
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.18,0:03:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is to take a real long cold\Nswim back to Infinity Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:04:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I have a feeling that if the mountain\Nis drifting farther and farther away,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then our friends are too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.36,0:04:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must all be out there\Non those other islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where will we end up if we just keep\Non drifting around like this, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.84,0:04:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.08,0:04:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you're from another world, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.00,0:04:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never left File Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.72,0:04:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Agumon, I've never\Nleft my world either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.40,0:04:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it could be worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.44,0:04:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There could be evil Digimon attacking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.92,0:04:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too quiet here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.04,0:04:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Fridgey Mon Fridgey Mon is a\Nfood-friendly snowman But don't worry,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.43,0:04:39.40,Sign,Sign,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}YUKIDARUMON
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.43,0:04:39.40,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Icy Snow Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.43,0:04:39.40,Sign,Sign,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.43,0:04:39.40,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.43,0:04:39.40,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Vaccine
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.43,0:04:39.40,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.43,0:04:39.40,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Zettai Reido Punch
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.06,0:04:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, he's a good Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.98,0:04:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, my belly's\Nfreezing. It's a black gear
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.08,0:04:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The black gear's controlling\Nhim. Sub-Zero Ice Punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.40,0:04:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you see that? Did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.84,0:05:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His punch froze that mailbox solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.90,0:05:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I better heat things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.86,0:05:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pepper Breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.04,0:05:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha! Frigimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.44,0:05:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really hope you have a backup plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.74,0:05:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sub-Zero Ice Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.80,0:05:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.96,0:05:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he touches us, we're\Ngonna be ice cubes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, and I'm so hungry, I\Ndon't have the strength to digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.36,0:05:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back here and fight, Courage Bonner!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.14,0:05:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're trapped like ice mice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere else to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.76,0:05:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got an idea, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.30,0:05:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pick me up and throw me at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.56,0:05:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can land right on his back,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.40,0:05:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can vaporize that black\Ngear with my pepper bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.94,0:05:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if this\Nis going to work, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.14,0:05:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can barely lift you, much\Nless throw you, tubbymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.04,0:05:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has to work, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.24,0:06:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our only chance. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.08,0:06:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sub-Zero Ice Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.98,0:06:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He really likes to bury\Nhimself in his work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.66,0:06:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, now's our shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.24,0:06:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roll up into a ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.58,0:06:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.49,0:06:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, now I'll show you why I'm\Nmy soccer team's best striker
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.74,0:06:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I doing lying here? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.62,0:06:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A black gear was on you and you almost\Nturned us into ice sculptures Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.68,0:06:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.60,0:06:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hate when I do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.08,0:06:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But thank you for destroying the gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.44,0:06:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're both all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.96,0:06:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you seen anyone else here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.46,0:06:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some more kids like me? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.84,0:06:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I did\Nsee another boy like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.58,0:06:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was with a Gabumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.22,0:07:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They fell onto that\Nother island over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.28,0:07:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw Gabumon? And Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.72,0:07:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.63,0:07:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt would land that far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.36,0:07:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too cold to swim, and we're\Ndrifting at 100 miles a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.76,0:07:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're a weird kid but since\Nyou got that black gear
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.00,0:07:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out of my aching back i'll\Nhelp you get across the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.40,0:07:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,water sub-zero ice hey\Nit's an ice bridge now we
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.04,0:07:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can walk to the island i hope\Nyour punches don't uh you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.28,0:07:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know freeze up don't worry\Nas long as it's cold i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.02,0:07:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,full of punch yeah baby\Nwhat if the ice breaks while
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.04,0:07:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're out there we could\Nbe Seadramon bait all right
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.86,0:07:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all right we get it quit\Nshaking up the whole island.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.96,0:07:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, does everybody in the digital\Nworld always have to be so noisy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.48,0:07:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.44,0:07:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's start walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.46,0:07:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T .K. T .K.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.70,0:07:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T .K., can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.08,0:07:54.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.06,0:07:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you, T .K.?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.80,0:07:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, you must save your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.94,0:08:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.20,0:08:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.11,0:08:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a cave right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.26,0:08:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go in and get warm\Nuntil the storm's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.74,0:08:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cave!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.68,0:08:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, that's where T .K.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.16,0:08:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is! Yes! T .K.!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.76,0:08:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.28,0:08:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.50,0:08:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so sure he'd be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.80,0:08:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then again, T .K.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.28,0:08:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,never liked caves that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.46,0:08:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There now, come and sit by the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.62,0:08:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't help T .K.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nor anyone for that\Nmatter if you get sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.82,0:08:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must rest to stay strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.34,0:08:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I gotta go back\Nout there and find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.78,0:08:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.94,0:08:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.02,0:08:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not leaving this cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go look for T.K. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.00,0:08:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.18,0:08:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm your Digimon, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.74,0:08:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here to help you through thick\Nand thin, whether it's hot or cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.52,0:08:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I've got a built-in\Nwarm fur coat, which you haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.56,0:08:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:08:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just sit right here and get warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.88,0:09:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.80,0:09:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be back in two shakes of a Digital.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor little T.K. It's just\Nnot right. He's my little
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.60,0:09:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,brother i should be the\None out there looking for
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.42,0:09:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dad, are we there yet? Sorry, I\Njust had to say that. Sub-Zero Ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.96,0:09:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that island's just\Nas far away as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take five, you guys,\Nand then we'll keep on going.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.60,0:09:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The island's still moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.80,0:09:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we stop, we may not be\Nable to catch up with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.30,0:09:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, if you could fly like\NBergeron, we'd be there already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.76,0:09:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.82,0:09:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bergeron probably can't\Nfly in the cold anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.34,0:09:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one toasts my clothes like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.06,0:09:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, lad. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.84,0:09:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I hate to see friends fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.62,0:09:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll carry you both across, like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.10,0:09:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.22,0:10:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, nice and comfy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.13,0:10:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, comfy as a mackerel on ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.40,0:10:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at least we'll still be nice\Nand fresh when we get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.70,0:10:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did I ever tell you about the party\NI went to that the Numemon crashed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.54,0:10:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's a party no one will forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.08,0:10:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, no sign of TK out here anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.00,0:10:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Matt will be so disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.76,0:10:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.28,0:10:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.74,0:10:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you not to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.74,0:10:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me? Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.60,0:10:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's frozen I have got to warm him up\Nor else or else he will never make it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.64,0:10:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but how all I have is my own\Nfur and hey that's it why
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.18,0:10:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not no one's here to see me\Nthere here you go my friend
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.22,0:10:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll feel better in no time\NGood thing we're alone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.02,0:11:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one Numemon kept following\Nmy sister, but I handled it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.46,0:11:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little Sub-Zero ice\Npunch, show and tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.26,0:11:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you two, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.48,0:11:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder where Gabumon and Matt landed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.64,0:11:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right in the middle, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.08,0:11:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they must be up there\Nsomewhere, in that forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.14,0:11:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, let's go for a hike.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.04,0:11:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then after that, we'll hike.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.32,0:11:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we can hike some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.60,0:11:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.72,0:11:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's a bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.04,0:11:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt must be around here somewhere. Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.06,0:12:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, can you hear me, Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.38,0:12:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Gabumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.08,0:12:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, I'm here! Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.90,0:12:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.81,0:12:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, are you out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.18,0:12:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.08,0:12:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, you took off your\Nfur for... Well, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.98,0:12:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.89,0:12:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, uh, it's good to see\Nyou're up and feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.18,0:12:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.00,0:12:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you kept me all warm\Nand now you have my comb.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.70,0:12:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bet you look pretty funny\Nwith no fur on, Gabumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.58,0:12:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.38,0:12:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.51,0:12:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Tai and Agumon! They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.16,0:12:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.06,0:12:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.92,0:12:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we'd never\Nfind you guys. It sure is
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.74,0:13:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lucky that we met up with\Nbridgie mon frosty the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.28,0:13:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,snowman here yep this is\Nhim he happened to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.96,0:13:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,two fall on this island\Nand then he got us here in
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.38,0:13:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no time a sub-zero ice\Npunch you know did you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.92,0:13:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see anyone else no when\Nit rains kids i usually
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.22,0:13:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,notice you were the only\Ntwo who fell here if there
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.56,0:13:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are more of you they must\Nbe on the other islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.86,0:13:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.12,0:13:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't worry, we'll find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.66,0:13:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch it, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.10,0:13:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.01,0:13:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not used to having a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.54,0:13:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cold, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.06,0:13:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.98,0:13:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go, Frigimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't catch his cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.58,0:13:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You already are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.68,0:13:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you get sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.70,0:13:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one with the fur around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.08,0:13:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop making fun of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.76,0:13:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.06,0:13:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't you chill out, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.00,0:13:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was only trying to see\Nhow we could help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.42,0:13:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, I think you ought to go\Ntake a rest for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.56,0:13:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.34,0:14:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to figure out what\Nwe're going to do next.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.78,0:14:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to go search for all the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.04,0:14:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right, but how are\Nwe supposed to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.96,0:14:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard what Frigimon said.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.62,0:14:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone landed on different islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.32,0:14:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you've got an airplane stashed\Naround here someplace, I think
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.56,0:14:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.47,0:14:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I guess we'll ask Frigimon for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.22,0:14:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weren't you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.68,0:14:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said they're scattered\Nall over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.64,0:14:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He only has two arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.10,0:14:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not an octopus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.40,0:14:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll have to make a raft\Nout of some of these trees, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.80,0:14:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.06,0:14:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, what's eating you, dude?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.32,0:14:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.42,0:14:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll help you get off this island if\Nwe have to build surfboards, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.64,0:14:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, the others will be\Nfine without us for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.36,0:14:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta focus on the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.44,0:14:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.84,0:14:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, I gotta spell it out for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.66,0:14:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta know if this island's\Nmoving toward that place
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.20,0:14:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devimon talked about that. That's\Nnot the real deal. You do. Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.60,0:14:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's nothing more\Nreal than our friends And
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.62,0:14:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,finding them and getting\Nus all back home safe
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.06,0:14:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't you ever\Nforget it You wanna ditch
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.74,0:14:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your friends to go look\Nfor some faraway land?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.06,0:15:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, but I'm not coming. I'll find\NT.K. I'll find all of them by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.02,0:15:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Matt Hey, come on,\Ndon't freak out on me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.18,0:15:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're not getting away that easy
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.60,0:15:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nobody runs away when\Ni'm still talking now
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.12,0:15:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,listen maybe there's\Nsomething across the ocean
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.46,0:15:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to help us find the\Nothers why do you have to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.32,0:15:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get so bent out of shape\Ni know how you feel matt
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.36,0:15:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh you haven't got a clue\Nhow i feel Tai you're
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.34,0:15:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,acting like such a jerk\Nwho are you calling a
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.56,0:15:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.16,0:15:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to work together, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.84,0:15:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.38,0:16:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, Tai, quit it. What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.96,0:16:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to stop them some way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.60,0:16:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's T.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.08,0:16:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's out there on some strange\Nisland, and he's all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.10,0:16:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.46,0:16:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, Tai, get away from that cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.16,0:16:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.20,0:16:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.74,0:16:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, just\Ndon't let go of my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.86,0:16:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up, guys. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.40,0:16:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.60,0:16:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so tired and hungry now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.34,0:16:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have any strength\Nleft at all We'd be
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.86,0:16:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,okay if I could just\Ndigivolve into Garurumon
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.24,0:16:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I think it's Mojyamon. That's him,\Nbut he has a black gear inside him.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.71,0:17:02.68,Sign,Sign,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}MOJYAMON
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.71,0:17:02.68,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Rare Animal Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.71,0:17:02.68,Sign,Sign,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.71,0:17:02.68,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.71,0:17:02.68,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Vaccine
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.71,0:17:02.68,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.71,0:17:02.68,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Icicle Rod\NHone Hone Boomerang
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mojyamon is a peaceful mountain Digimon\Nthat doesn't like fighting. You'd
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.34,0:17:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,better tell him that He doesn't look\Nvery peaceful right now Ice Cloud!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.36,0:17:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's raining kids and Digimon again I'm\Ngonna have to start carrying an umbrella
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.22,0:17:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Frigimon Good timing\NWithout you, we'd be flat as pancakes
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.04,0:17:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, next time, try not to land on my\Nhead Here, I brought some food Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.12,0:17:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.94,0:17:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's good and tasty\Njust the way I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.06,0:17:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An old cold remedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.48,0:17:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take your emoji, Mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.78,0:18:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Richie, Mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.74,0:18:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolute Zero Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.36,0:18:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boomerang bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.90,0:18:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice trick, Mojyamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.62,0:18:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now watch ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.02,0:18:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ankylomon, Digivolve, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.30,0:18:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.96,0:18:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, Digivolve, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.90,0:19:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it, Garurumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.16,0:19:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.12,0:19:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.96,0:19:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not playing nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.70,0:19:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Koromon, aim for the black gear
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.30,0:19:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.74,0:19:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.90,0:19:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did it, Koromon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.14,0:19:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phew, now that's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.92,0:19:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back down to standard Mojyamon size.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.16,0:19:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon, what are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.40,0:19:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, just look at all those black dears.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.16,0:19:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a mountain number.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.22,0:19:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, I feel like I was just\Nrun over by a monochromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.06,0:20:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A black gear was\Ncontrolling you, Mojyamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.84,0:20:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, the fight wasn't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.00,0:20:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.91,0:20:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same thing happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.20,0:20:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.26,0:20:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one got hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.17,0:20:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't change anything, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.60,0:20:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still have to go find the others. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.44,0:20:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, the gears have fixed themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.50,0:20:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be Devimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.00,0:20:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the island's moving again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.76,0:20:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're moving all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.16,0:20:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other way, back\Ntoward Infinity Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.56,0:20:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Devimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.62,0:20:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's true, then this is\Nno time for us to be fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.12,0:20:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.10,0:20:35.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No stinking gears are going to stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.16,0:20:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, together we're\Ngoing to be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.54,0:20:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now I know my little brother\Nwill be all right because
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.42,0:20:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he has Patamon to take care\Nof him when I can't be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.96,0:20:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I think as long as we\Ncan all trust each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.94,0:20:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,together it's a sure bet that we'll\Nbe able to fight and beat Devimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.84,0:21:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish. How are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.98,0:21:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish. How are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.89,0:21:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.24,0:21:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not all that you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.04,0:22:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.24,0:22:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.86,0:22:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The children of the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.20,0:22:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are in a safe place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.02,0:22:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are in trouble with their feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.60,0:22:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are in the middle of the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.74,0:22:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of them are in\Nthe middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.22,0:22:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, the Digimon adventure.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.58,0:24:00.00,Sign,Sign,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fs30\b1}Kentarumon the Defender!

